We need to import RxJava classes.

Write JMH benchmark class:

```
import org.openjdk.jmh.annotations.*;
import io.reactivex.rxjava3.core.Maybe;
import java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;

@State(Scope.Thread)
public class MaybeTimeoutBenchmark {
    @Benchmark
    public Object timeoutImmediate() {
        return Maybe.just(1)
                .timeout(Maybe.timer(0, TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS), Maybe.empty())
                .blockingGet();
    }
}
```

